### Goal Model Decomposition

The mission description involves delivering food from the kitchen to an inpatient room and retrieving dirty dishes, with considerations for uncertainty, cooperation between robots and humans, and tracking of meals. The goal model is designed to capture the hierarchical decomposition of goals and tasks, considering AND/OR decompositions and runtime annotations.

---

### Goals Table

| Goal ID | Goal Title                                   | Text                                                                                                                                                                                                 | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type      | Relation |
|--------|----------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------|---------------|---------|
| G1     | Manage Food Delivery and Dish Retrieval Process | Ensure food is delivered to the inpatient room and dirty dishes are retrieved, considering cooperation between robots and humans, and tracking of meals.                              | ;                  | Perform        | -        |
| G2     | Deliver Food to Inpatient Room               | Deliver food from the kitchen to the inpatient room, considering tray retrieval and cooperation with humans or robots.                                                                          | #                  | Perform        | G1       |
| G3     | Retrieve Dirty Dishes                        | Retrieve dirty dishes from the inpatient room, considering cooperation between robots and humans.                                                                                              | #                  | Perform        | G1       |
| G4     | Monitor and Alert                            | Monitor the delivery and retrieval process and alert if a wrong meal is retrieved or if there are issues during the process.                                                                    | -                  | Achieve       | G1       |

